    <question_explanation no="17" id="PRB-2551232F5DCC3D07-Q17">
      <question_stem>밀도가 500 kg/m^(3)인 도시폐기물 200 kg을 800 kg/m^(3)으로 압축했을 때, 부피감소율[%]은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="수치/계산 도출형" category="수리·계산·자료해석형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>밀도</keyword>
        <keyword>도시폐기물</keyword>
        <keyword>압축했</keyword>
        <keyword>부피감소율</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>2</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>37.5</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답가안</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 환경공학개론 · 압축 부피감소율
정답은 ②이다. 압축 전 부피 = 200 ÷ 500 = 0.4 m³, 압축 후 부피 = 200 ÷ 800 = 0.25 m³이다. 부피감소율 = (0.4 - 0.25) ÷ 0.4 × 100 = 37.5%이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>16.5</choice_text>
          <commentary>계산이 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>37.5</choice_text>
          <commentary>37.5%이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>50.5</choice_text>
          <commentary>계산이 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>60.0</choice_text>
          <commentary>계산이 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
